2	 *
3	 * Sections: utils · api · state · board render · detail render · review/diff
4	 * render · activity render · dialog · keyboard · polling · boot.
5	 *
6	 * Rule: every server-provided string goes through esc() before it reaches
7	 * innerHTML. Regions that hold user input (answer textarea, dialog) are static
8	 * DOM that is never re-rendered; other regions are re-rendered only when their
9	 * generated HTML actually changes, so scroll / <details> / focus survive polls.
10	 */
